Slide 1 – Campaign Overview

Project: 360° Digital Growth Campaign

Company: Codomax Digital Solutions

Website: https://codomaxdigital.in/

Internship Page: https://codomaxdigital.in/internship

Objective:
Develop a comprehensive digital marketing strategy to improve internship awareness, attract student audiences, and encourage registrations.

Slide 2 – Campaign Objectives

The campaign focused on five major objectives:

Improve organic search visibility through SEO.

Create useful content for students.

Increase internship awareness through social media.

Identify backlink and partnership opportunities.

Improve the internship page's registration experience.

