Slide 10 – Conversion Rate Optimization

The Codomax internship page was reviewed.

Audit Areas:

Headline clarity

Call-to-action placement

Trust signals

Certificate information

Mobile usability

Registration journey

Recommendations:

Use clear benefit-focused headlines.

Keep registration buttons visible.

Display verifiable trust information.

Explain certificate conditions transparently.

Improve mobile readability.

Simplify the registration process.

